# Udemy Courses Analysis (Power BI)

A multi-page interactive Power BI report analyzing Udemy courses: subscribers, pricing, reviews, and content, to understand which subjects and pricing strategies attract the most learners.

![Home](Home.PNG)

## Business Questions
- Which subjects have the most courses and the most subscribers?
- How does price relate to course length and popularity?
- Do free courses attract more learners than paid ones, and how do reviews and content volume compare?
- How did the number of courses and subscribers change over the years?

## Dataset
- **Source:** Public Udemy courses dataset (add the link here)
- **Size:** 3,676 courses across 4 subjects (Web Development, Business Finance, Graphic Design, Musical Instruments)
- **Main fields:** subject, course title, level, payment (Free/Paid), price, price category, number of lectures, content duration, number of reviews, number of subscribers, year

## Tools
Power BI Desktop: Power Query (data cleaning), DAX measures, interactive visuals, slicers, page navigation buttons

